            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Create and display the variable <code>tries_left</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"tries_left = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(tries_left)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print(levels)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>tries_left = 2</code>, followed by <code>print(tries_left)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Create the global variable <code>tries_left</code> as <code>2</code>, then display it so the code prints <code>2</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"tries_left = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(tries_left)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print(levels)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tries_left = 3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>tries_left = 2</code>, followed by <code>print(tries_left)</code>.</p></body></html>"
